#: thold_templates.php:1622
msgid "This is the Email subject that will be displayed in the Email (128 Char MAX).  Leave blank for the default.  There are several common replacement tags that may be used in include:<br>&#060PHASE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDVALUE&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060BREACHUP&#062 &#060REALERT&#062 &#60HOSTNAME&#62"
